<title>USA: BankBoston names Willis co-head of new unit.</title>
<headline>BankBoston names Willis co-head of new unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankBoston Corp unit BancBoston Securities Inc said it named Steven Willis managing director and co-head of the newly formed capital markets group within the firm's emerging markets unit.</p>
<p>The group will focus on raising capital for issuers in Latin America, Asia and Eastern Europe, BankBoston said.</p>
<p>Before joining BancBoston, Willis was managing director and head of Yankee capital markets at UBS Securities Inc, the firm said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1868 ))</p>
